[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":111},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-nnpc-seplat-teachers-empowerment-programme-2026-apply-now-65":3},{"news":4,"more":28},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":27},65,"nnpc-seplat-teachers-empowerment-programme-2026-apply-now-65","Nnpc\u002Fseplat Teachers Empowerment Programme 2026 | Apply Now","\u003Cp>Applications are now being accepted from all qualified and interested candidates for the NNPC\u002FSEPLAT Teachers Empowerment Programme Government Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: NNPC\u002FSEPLAT\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: NIGERIA\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ftrainings\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Trainings\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Training\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Training\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Empowerment\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Digital Tools and Skills\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: March 13, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>NNPC\u002FSEPLAT Teachers Empowerment Programme Details\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The NNPC\u002FSEPLAT Teachers Empowerment Programme is an annual joint training program organized by the NNPC Exploration and Production Limited (NEPL) and Seplat Energy.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Seplat Teachers Empowerment Program (STEP) equips educators with critical thinking competencies, leadership capacity and technology-enabled instructional tools designed to improve learning outcomes.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To promote creative thinking, allow for higher student engagement, and offer a well-rounded education, Seplat has introduced the STEAM model of learning to secondary schools in Delta and Edo States; where Science, Technology, Engineering, Arts, and Mathematics (STEAM) are equal contributors to the process of learning.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>NNPC\u002FSEPLAT Teachers Empowerment Programme Benefits\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Successsful applicants for the NNPC\u002FSEPLAT Teachers Empowerment Programme will gain:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Leadership training\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Critical thinking competencies,\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Technology-enabled instructional tools\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Mentorship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>NNPC\u002FSEPLAT Teachers Empowerment Programme Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the NNPC\u002FSEPLAT Teachers Empowerment Programme, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>B a Nigeria Citizen\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be a teacher\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be teaching in any recognized in Edo or Delta State\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>AAPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.seplatenergy.com\u002Fnews-insights\u002Fnews\u002Fnnpcseplat-teachers-empowerment-programme-2026\u002F\">https:\u002F\u002Fwww.seplatenergy.com\u002Fnews-insights\u002Fnews\u002Fnnpcseplat-teachers-empowerment-programme-2026\u002F\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-03-11 09:52:10",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fnnpc-seplat-teachers-empowerment-programme-2026-apply-now\u002F69b12d3ad2ce49.48972171_screenshot 2026-03-11 094228.png","image","","https:\u002